      "update_time": 1710134178,
      "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:24.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">养机（优化）</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:24.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">手机双清，恢复出厂设置</font><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">次，格式化</font><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\">次，下载抖音，抖音极速版，今日头条，今日头条极速版后</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);\r\nfont-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">不登录</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">，先去抖音搜索仙侠游戏</font><font face=\"Calibri\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">传奇游戏，观看几个视频后，再去抖音极速版搜索仙侠游戏，找到有关仙侠游戏的直播，在直播间挂</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">个小时，后清空后台息屏</font><font face=\"Calibri\">30</font><font face=\"宋体\">分钟。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">打开今日头条极速版搜索仙侠游戏</font><font face=\"Calibri\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">传奇游戏，找到有广告标识的游戏（表明穿山甲最近广告主投放的游戏广告）点击下载，下载两个，不要打开。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/8b587cefa2b60f953b9fb704cae19cbe.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 244px;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:0.0000pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:0.0000;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">打开抖音极速版再次找一个有关仙侠游戏</font><font face=\"Calibri\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">传奇游戏有关的直播间在挂一个小时，后息屏。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:0.0000pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:0.0000;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">如果打开今日头条极速版，在首页推荐中出现有关仙侠游戏</font><font face=\"Calibri\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">传奇游戏相关的视频或者是广告，在搜索栏中出现相关游戏的关键词（说明这些游戏是广告主有投流），可以根据搜索栏中的关键词去搜索游戏下载（</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1-2</font><font face=\"宋体\">个游戏）或者出现有关游戏直播，可以点进去挂着，如下截图所示：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/3ccabd97ba4daef377e6caf1858dc786.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 213px;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/f19dac0343aea914be1d3c4d86e1e234.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 317px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:0.0000pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:0.0000;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">可以选择</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">个你在头条下载的游戏玩一玩（带广告标识的游戏，个人推荐仙侠游戏，除了</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font><font face=\"宋体\">元首充外，每天还可以有</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">元特惠充值，维持权重）每天都打开玩一玩，玩的时长自己决定。</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/28a234825bc454802f5f8a497e161cb1.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 278px;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">注：判断自己手机有没有养好还可以下载一个</font><font face=\"Calibri\">wifi</font><font face=\"宋体\">万能钥匙，打开如果开屏广告和主页的推荐页是穿山甲的广告，手机养的差不多了，如果不是，可能还差一点，如图：</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/abf17cb29bf9de88311111f10543321c.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 181px;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/1118fb35d46d4f7ae952a21fca3f0cf3.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 181px;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/948e774bcbc34dc6d29b7b46ca2d2fe5.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 182px;\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:0.0000pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:0.0000;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\">快速养机，比如你养好一台手机，点我们自己游戏的广告出现是</font><font face=\"宋体\">“热血江湖”游戏，那可以在另外一台你要养的手机上打开今日头条极速版搜索“热血江湖”，点击下载，然后按上面步骤操作，以此类推，如图：</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"margin-left:0.0000pt;mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-indent:0.0000pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:0.0000;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/e141d48e2c786c2c3eef392f91025b69.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><img src=\"https://api.xmchujian.com/uploads/20240311/a92bb8f2229f16b2938f8ee6a8e378d3.png\" data-filename=\"filename\" style=\"width: 248px;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><font face=\"Calibri\">7.</font><font face=\"宋体\">注意点</font></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">①不管是打开什么软件，只要是有请求位置权限的，</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);\r\nfont-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">全部点禁止。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);\r\nfont-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);\r\nfont-size:14.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">②自己感觉手机养的差不多了，自己游戏广告金币也稳定了，打开抖音要是有跳出登陆的可以选择登陆。</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:14.0000pt;\r\nmso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"mso-para-margin-left:0.0000gd;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
